es and smart watches will be secured in Yondr cases that will be opened at 
 
the end of the event. Guests maintain possession of their phones at all tim
 
es\, and can access their phones throughout the show at designated Phone Us
 
e Areas in the venue. All phones will be re-secured in Yondr cases before r
 
eturning to the performance space. Anyone seen using a cellphone during the
 
 performance will be escorted out of the venue. We appreciate your cooperat
 
ion in creating a phone-free viewing experience. DO NOT PURCHASE TICKETS FR
 
OM ANYONE OR ANY OTHER SITE OTHER THAN IMPROV.COM TICKET RESALE IS STRICTLY
 
